## ✅ Functional Requirements

<details>
<summary><strong>Auth & User Management</strong></summary>

- Patient registration/login (JWT-based)
- Doctor registration — requires admin approval before going live
- Admin login (seeded, not publicly registrable)
- Role-based route protection middleware
- Profile management (age/gender/history for patients; specialization/qualifications/fee for doctors)
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Doctor Discovery</strong></summary>

- Browse/search doctors by specialization, location, availability, rating
- Doctor profile page with bio, qualifications, fee, reviews, and available slots
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Availability & Scheduling</strong></summary>

- Doctor sets weekly availability and blocks leave days
- System auto-generates bookable slots from availability rules
- Slots marked unavailable once booked (concurrency-safe)
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Appointments</strong></summary>

- Patient books an available slot, selects consult type (in-person/video)
- Status lifecycle: `pending → confirmed → completed / cancelled / no_show`
- Doctor can accept/reject a pending appointment
- Either party can cancel with a reason, subject to a cancellation policy
- Automated reminders before appointments
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Payments</strong></summary>

- Stripe checkout for consultation fees (test mode)
- Refund logic on valid cancellations
- Platform commission deducted from doctor's fee
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Consultation</strong></summary>

- Real-time chat between patient and doctor
- Video consultation link
- Doctor uploads prescription/notes after the appointment
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Medical Records</strong></summary>

- Patient medical history — past appointments, prescriptions, reports
- Doctor can view a patient's relevant history before a consult
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Reviews</strong></summary>

- Patient rates/reviews doctor after a completed appointment
- Ratings aggregate on doctor profile
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Admin Panel</strong></summary>

- Approve/reject doctor registrations
- Manage users (block/unblock)
- Oversee appointments, handle disputes/no-shows
- Platform analytics dashboard
</details>

<details>
<summary><strong>Notifications</strong></summary>

- In-app and email notifications for confirmations, reminders, cancellations, and prescriptions
</details>

---

## 📱 Screens

~28 screens across three portals — public pages, shared pages (dashboard, appointment tracking, chat, notifications, profile), patient-only pages (booking, medical history, reviews), doctor-only pages (availability manager, consultation view, earnings), and admin-only pages (doctor verification queue, user management, analytics).

